{
 "_meta": {
  "read": "2026-10-23",
  "method": "Maker pages only. Each record was read on 2026-10-23, Pacific time, from the maker's own product page, fetched as static HTML with curl and turned into plain text. Where a maker lists several models on one page, the model's own line on that page was used, which applies to the Gazelle Ultimate variants and the Gazelle Eclipse C380+. No retailer, review or video site was used. Every quote was checked by script as an exact substring of the saved page text. A quote with \" ... \" joins fragments from the same page, each one verbatim. Where the page gives only volts and amp-hours, battery_wh is volts times amp-hours and the quote ends with a bracketed note that says so. classes lists every class the page names for the bike, including classes the maker says come from an app setting or an optional throttle or kit, for example the Aventon Current models, Level 4 ADV and Aventure M. top_assist_mph is the highest speed the page states for the bike, including speeds the maker says are unlocked in the app. motor_rated_w is rated or nominal watts and is null when only peak watts are given. weight_lb is null when the page gives it only without the battery or gives conflicting figures. throttle is true when the page names a throttle, false when the page says the bike has none as sold, and null when the page is silent. Skipped, with reasons in models_report.md, were models already in catalog.json, models whose page states no class or no battery size, pages that could not be fetched or only render their specs with script, and pages whose figures could not be tied to one model. Juiced Bikes now lists only the Scrambler. The RipRacer, Scorpion X2 and HyperScorpion links redirect to the home page and the RipRunner and CrossCurrent X links return 404."
 },
